  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nSomeone sent me a direct chat invite and I cannot accept or reject it\r\n\r\n### Detailed explanation\r\n\r\n- Someone sent me a direct chat invite\r\n- That person is from a homeserver (different from mine) which is currently down\r\n- On Riot, I click on the invite, then click on \"accept\": I get a \"Failed to join room\" message saying \"No known servers\"\r\n- On Riot, I click on the invite, then click on \"reject\": I get a \"Failed to reject invite\" message saying \"Not a known room\"\r\n- On Riot, I click on the \"...\" to the right of the invite, then click on \"reject\" and \"OK\": I get a \"Failed to reject invitation\" message saying \"M_UNKNOWN: Not a known room\"\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Platform**:       virtual private server running debian jesse\r\n- **Install method**: package manager\r\n- **Version**:        0.27.4",
